messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 314771 and 397845? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 314771 and 397845, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers vertically by their place values, with the ones place aligned with the ones place, the tens place aligned with the tens place, and so on. Then, we add the numbers column by column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left.\n\nHere's the step-by-step process:.\n\n1. Align the numbers vertically by their place values:.\n\n```.\n  314771.\n+ 397845.\n```.\n\n2. Add the numbers column by column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n```.\n  314771.\n+ 397845.\n  ------.\n   100616.\n```.\n\n3. In the ones place, we add 1 + 5 = 6. Write down 6 in the ones place of the sum.\n\n4. In the tens place, we add 7 + 4 = 11. Write down 1 in the tens place of the sum and carry over 1 to the hundreds place.\n\n5. In the hundreds place, we add 4 + 8 + 1 (the carried over 1) = 13. Write down 3 in the hundreds place of the sum and carry over 1 to the thousands place.\n\n6. In the thousands place, we add 7 + 7 + 1 (the carried over 1) = 15. Write down 5 in the thousands place of the sum and carry over 1 to the ten-thousands place.\n\n7. In the ten-thousands place, we add 1 + 9 + 1 (the carried over 1) = 11. Write down 1 in the ten-thousands place of the sum and carry over 1 to the hundred-thousands place.\n\n8. In the hundred-thousands place, we add 3 + 3 + 1 (the carried over 1) = 7. Write down 7 in the hundred-thousands place of the sum.\n\n9. Finally, we have the sum of 314771 and 397845, which is 712616.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
