messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 323313 and 381028? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 323313 and 381028, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers vertically by their place values, with the ones place aligned with the ones place, the tens place aligned with the tens place, and so on. Then, we add the numbers column by column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left.\n\nHere's the step-by-step process:.\n\n1. Align the numbers vertically by their place values:.\n\n```.\n  323313.\n+ 381028.\n```.\n\n2. Add the numbers column by column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place):.\n\n```.\n  323313.\n+ 381028.\n  ------.\n   11.\n```.\n\n3. Write down the result of the ones place addition (11) in the ones place of the sum:.\n\n```.\n  323313.\n+ 381028.\n  ------.\n   11.\n```.\n\n4. Move to the next column (the tens place) and add the numbers:.\n\n```.\n  323313.\n+ 381028.\n  ------.\n  111.\n```.\n\n5. Write down the result of the tens place addition (111) in the tens place of the sum:.\n\n```.\n  323313.\n+ 381028.\n  ------.\n  1111.\n```.\n\n6. Move to the next column (the hundreds place) and add the numbers:.\n\n```.\n  323313.\n+ 381028.\n  ------.\n  11111.\n```.\n\n7. Write down the result of the hundreds place addition (11111) in the hundreds place of the sum:.\n\n```.\n  323313.\n+ 381028.\n  ------.\n  111111.\n```.\n\n8. Move to the next column (the thousands place) and add the numbers:.\n\n```.\n  323313.\n+ 381028.\n  ------.\n  111111.\n```.\n\n9. Write down the result of the thousands place addition (111111) in the thousands place of the sum:.\n\n```.\n  323313.\n+ 381028.\n  ------.\n  1111111.\n```.\n\n10. Move to the next column (the ten-thousands place) and add the numbers:.\n\n```.\n  323313.\n+ 381028.\n  ------.\n  1111111.\n```.\n\n11. Write down the result of the ten-thousands place addition (1111