messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 954931 and 913776? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo find the sum of 954931 and 913776, we can use the standard addition algorithm. We start by aligning the numbers vertically by their place values, with the ones place aligned with the ones place, the tens place aligned with the tens place, and so on. Then, we add the numbers column by column, starting from the rightmost column (the ones place) and moving to the left.\n\nHere's the step-by-step process:.\n\n1. Align the numbers vertically:.\n\n```.\n  954931.\n+ 913776.\n```.\n\n2. Add the numbers in the ones place: 1 + 6 = 7. Write down 7 in the ones place of the sum.\n\n```.\n  954931.\n+ 913776.\n  ------.\n    7.\n```.\n\n3. Add the numbers in the tens place: 3 + 7 = 10. Write down 0 in the tens place of the sum and carry over 1 to the hundreds place.\n\n```.\n  954931.\n+ 913776.\n  ------.\n   07.\n```.\n\n4. Add the numbers in the hundreds place: 9 + 7 + 1 (carried over) = 17. Write down 7 in the hundreds place of the sum and carry over 1 to the thousands place.\n\n```.\n  954931.\n+ 913776.\n  ------.\n  707.\n```.\n\n5. Add the numbers in the thousands place: 4 + 3 + 1 (carried over) = 8. Write down 8 in the thousands place of the sum.\n\n```.\n  954931.\n+ 913776.\n  ------.\n  8707.\n```.\n\n6. Add the numbers in the ten-thousands place: 5 + 1 = 6. Write down 6 in the ten-thousands place of the sum.\n\n```.\n  954931.\n+ 913776.\n  ------.\n  86707.\n```.\n\n7. Add the numbers in the hundred-thousands place: 9 + 9 = 18. Write down 8 in the hundred-thousands place of the sum and carry over 1 to the millions place.\n\n```.\n  954931.\n+ 913776.\n  ------.\n  886707.\n```.\n\n8. Add the numbers in the millions place: 9 + 0 + 1 (carried over) = 10. Write down 0 in the millions place of the sum and carry over 1 to the ten-millions place.\n\n```.\n  954931.\n+ 913776.\n  ------.\n  986707.\n```.\n\n9. Add the numbers in the ten-millions place: 0 + 0 + 1 (carried over) = 1. Write down 1 in the ten-millions place of the sum.\n\n```.\n  954931.\n+ 913776.\n  ------.\n  986707.\n```.\n\nThe sum of 954931 and 913776 is 1868707.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
